1. Refactored RefTermSemanticEngine to delegate to SimilarityMatcher:
   - Added: self.similarity_matcher = SimilarityMatcher(engine=base_engine)
   - Changed find_best_match() to call similarity_matcher.find_best_substring()
   - Changed match_with_cluster() to reuse SimilarityMatcher
